<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.08 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.08 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 7.08 percent in the week ending Dec 14 from 6.88 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES    Dec 14, 1996  Dec 7, 1996  Dec 16, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.08	  +6.88	   +6.4</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.0	  318.6	   297.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended Dec 16, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
